<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">FILEMONI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku Filemoni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda Pawuli wu kasonika ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda Pawuli wu kasonika ku mukundi andi Filemoni. Muntu bewowo mwisi Kolose wudi, mpe muntu wuwunene wudi mu mbanza awu. Wuyuwa Pawuli bu kedi longa Musamu Wumbote, hansi na nsi wusa kiminu na wukota mu kabu di minkwikidi. Kuba na muntu wuba ha kati di mindongo myandi, nkumbu andi Onezime. Onezime wusala tina, na wuyena Pawuli bo bu kaba mu boloko. Pawuli wumulonga Musamu Wumbote, makwe zonzilanga misamu mitadidi Mfumu Yesu-Klisto. Yandi mpe wulanda nzila yi Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wusonika mukanda bewuwu ku Filemoni mu muteela ti kalemvokila Onezime. Yandi bende Onezime wu nata wo. Mu misiku mi ntangu beyoyo, Filemoni wuba na luve mu hidika Onezime misamu mi katiidi hoti ku muhonda mpe. Pawuli wubombidila mu mukanda bewowo balembolo bongila Onezime bonso mundongo wusala tina. Wumuteela ka mubwana bumbote, mu dyambu ti beka muntu wumosi mu Yesu-Klisto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Pawuli wuvutula matondo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Pawuli wubombidila Filemoni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Mbote zimanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Meno ni Pawuli, wubatuula mu boloko mu dyambu di Yesu-Klisto, na mpangi ani Timote tusonikini ku ngeye Filemoni mpangi eto yi zola yi kisalu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na ku kibusi kyeto Apiya, na ku Alisipo mpangi eto yikwe nwananga mvita neto, mpe na ku dibundu dikwe yonzamanga ku nzo aku. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Bika Nzambi, Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzolo na kiminu ki Filemoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ntangu zimvimba zina kwe sambilanga, kwe kubambukilanga moyo na kwe vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />mu dyambu ti nayudi kikuumu ki kiminu kyaku mu Mfumu Yesu na luzolo lwaku ku bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Nina lomba ku Nzambi ti, kiminu kii neto ntwadi kiba kisyama mu ngeye, mwanki misamu mimbote mimvimba mii neto mu Klisto mitoma zabakana. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Mpangi ani, luzolo lwaku lumpeeni kyese kikingi mpe lutomini nsyamisa, mu dyambu ti wukindisi mitima mi bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndombolo yi Pawuli mu dyambu di Onezime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ni hahoho, mpeleko mu kintwadi kyeto mu Klisto, nii na kimpwanza mu kutuma misamu mi fweti hidika, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />kansi ntiidi kwani mu kulomba mu dyambu di luzolo lweto. Meno Pawuli, kinunu kii kikangama bwabu mu boloko mu dyambu di Yesu-Klisto, <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />nina kubombidila mu dyambu di Onezime, yondowo wuhikidi mwana ani mu Yesu-Klisto mu kati di boloko. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Mu ntama, kaba mfunu ku ngeye ko, kansi bwabu wuhikidi mfunu ku meno na ku ngeye.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Yandi wuhikidi bwabu mwana ani wu mutima na nina muvutula ku ngeye. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Natya ti na musimbidila ehaha ha nidi, mwanki ka nsadisa ha kibuka kyaku mu ntangu yi nakidi mu boloko mu dyambu di Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Kansi natiidi mu hidika dyambu ko wulembolo teka zaba luzolo lwaku, mwanki wuhidika musamu bonso budi mutima aku wumbote, kansi ka mukukwikisa ko.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Bulendi ba ti Onezime wuba wutatuka naaku mu mwa ntangu yifyoti, mwanki wubwesa ba kintwadi nandi ntangu zimvimba. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Mu dyambu ti kasiidi dyaka bonso mundongo wumpamba ko. Kansi hyokidi mundongo mfunu: weka mpangi yi zola. Meno ntomini mu tya, mpe ngeye waavula mutya, ka mu kinsuni kaka ko, kansi mu kintwadi na Mfumu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Tala ti kwe mbongilanga bonso mpangi aku yi kiminu mu Klisto, mubwana bonso ti meno kwandi wuna bwana. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Tala ti musamu wumbi kakuhidika, hoti kima kana kudefa, tuula kyo mu nkumbu ani. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Meno Pawuli, nina kusonikina mu kooko kwani, mbo nakufuta. Ntiidi mu kubambula moyo ko ti, ngeye mpe mfuka yii naku ku meno, ni luzingu lwaku. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ninga mpangi ani, nina kubombidila, mpidikila musamu bewuwu mu zola ku Mfumu: kindisa mutima ani, mu dyambu di kintwadi kyeto mu Klisto.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Mu ntangu beyiyi yi nina kusonikina, nsidi kivuvu ti waahidika mimvimba mi nina kulomba. Mpe nzebi ti waahidika mivudidi. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Nina kulomba dyaka ti, wunkubikila kihinga. Nii na kivuvu ti naavutuka ku ludi mu dyambu di zinsambulu zeno.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimbote zimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafalasi, wudi naani mu boloko mu dyambu di Yesu-Klisto, wukutambikidi mbote, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />bumosi mpe na Malako, na Alisitalaki, na Demasi, na Luka, yawu bakwe salanga naani mu kisalu ki Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Bika Mfumu Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna!<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>